#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:1
msgid "Checks and Obligations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:3
msgid ""
"The compiler verifies the whole module before any MLIR is built. Types carry "
"the static facts, the verifier checks how operations connect, and everything "
"dynamic stays with the author at `unsafe` boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:11
msgid ""
"Where ctm-rs sits: typed carriers select instruction families, one of two "
"compiler profiles consumes them, and the author keeps the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:14
msgid "What is checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "Layer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "Checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "Rust types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"layout, swizzle, operand role, element format, MMA shape, pipeline stage "
"count, barrier ids; `TensorMut` over `DisjointSlice`; `TmemGuard` typestate; "
"sealed traits"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "cute-layout proofs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"cooperative copy coverage and per-thread contiguity, `ldmatrix` source "
"validity, TMA encodability and swizzle phase alignment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "dialect-cute verifier"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"tensor provenance, one pipeline init with complete producer and consumer "
"state, cursor provenance, scheduler grids, MMA placement, epilogue phases, "
"no compiler-only type reaches runtime storage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "Target gate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"`sm_100a` or `sm_120a`; `tcgen05` only on `sm_100a`; MXF4 register MMA only "
"on `sm_120a`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid "Launch ABI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:7
msgid ""
"cubin argument sizes and offsets match the exported MLIR; `#[grid_constant] "
"&TensorMap` is a 128-byte by-value argument aligned to 64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:24
msgid ""
"Any failure stops the build. The importer is closed-world: a `cute_rs::` "
"call it does not recognise is an error, not a fallback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:27
msgid "What you own"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:29
msgid "Thread convergence and which lanes take part in each collective."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:30
msgid "Barrier phases, arrival counts and transaction bytes at run time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:31
msgid "Asynchronous completion before a buffer or TMEM column is reused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:32
msgid ""
"Pointer lifetimes behind raw views and descriptors; the tensors a descriptor "
"points to must stay alive until the GPU is done with them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:34
msgid "Disjoint writes across threads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:36
msgid "Two rules worth remembering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:38
msgid ""
"**SM100 collective TMA loads.** `Sm100ClusterTmaCopy::copy` needs all 32 "
"lanes of the producer warp with identical arguments; the operation elects a "
"lane internally. An outer elected-lane branch deadlocks once a stage is "
"reused. TMA stores have one issuing thread, so this rule does not apply to "
"them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:43
msgid ""
"**The A collector on SM100.** CUTLASS 4.7's MMA atom cannot choose when to "
"fill or release the A collector, so the backend emits the `tcgen05` MMA "
"instruction from the verified plan:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:47
msgid ""
"each K16:   first N partition   ──►  fill the A collector\n"
"            second N partition  ──►  last use of the A collector\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:52
msgid ""
"Translation owns the descriptor bits, instruction selection, barrier "
"arrivals, completion multicast and TMEM fences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:55
msgid "Grid-constant launch arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:57
msgid ""
"#[grid_constant] desc: &TensorMap<...>\n"
"\n"
"host descriptor  ──►  128-byte launch argument  ──►  device &TensorMap<...>\n"
"                      aligned to 64 bytes            same address for every "
"thread\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../cute/contracts.md:64
msgid ""
"The descriptor needs no device allocation. The full launch contract is under "
"[Kernels and Device Functions](../gpu-programming/kernels-and-device-"
"functions.md)."
msgstr ""
